{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《夫妻的博弈》昨晚（24日）播出一集，施繼威 Mark（張頴康飾）終於向雪文 Sherman（郭柏妍飾）求婚。正當Sherman 以為終於一圓成家立室的美夢時，卻遇上人生最大考驗「麻煩奶奶」佩貞（林漪娸飾）！一場充滿火藥味又極具喜感的「婆媳大鬥法」正式上演，瞬間引爆網民強烈共鳴！</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4c5b2a75-2bf1-463e-9a2a-90e7c1ff17e2.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ait1kqRNHv1787630948.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4c5b2a75-2bf1-463e-9a2a-90e7c1ff17e2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">劇情講到 Sherman 去試婚紗時，特意挑選了一件露肩兼裙尾開衩設計的性感款式，完美展現其優越的身材比例，索到爆燈！點知奶奶佩貞見到當場黑面，毫不留情狠批新抱衣著過於暴露：「嘩！做乜擠晒出嚟㗎！你做人老婆喇，收返埋佢喇！」令現場氣氛瞬間跌至冰點。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">不單止揀婚紗無得話事，連結婚請帖與酒席地點都全被奶奶一手掌控！佩貞堅持要在屋邨酒樓舉辦婚宴，聲稱「龍鳳大禮堂夠喜慶」，實質只是貪便宜可以豁免酒水，將「控制狂」本色發揮得淋漓盡致。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cb2e4a06-9b78-40a7-828f-3382b8563401.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026LtSccRXSCm1787630948.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cb2e4a06-9b78-40a7-828f-3382b8563401.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f1805102-8d89-4fe9-8d50-f67346a5f2e0.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ajKXmHakTE1787630948.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f1805102-8d89-4fe9-8d50-f67346a5f2e0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">一心打算在六星級酒店辦夢幻婚宴的Sherman，眼見「媽寶」男友 Mark 在旁零話事權兼完全無幫口，唯有主動出擊，終極大反擊：「咁依家係你嫁定係我嫁啊？」佩貞亦唔係省油的燈，霸氣回敬：「咁係你嫁入嚟我哋門喇！你將來姓施，個仔又係姓施，係唔係？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">這集「婆媳大戰」播出後，火速成為網民熱話！大批觀眾大讚郭柏妍與林漪娸火花十足，喜感爆棚。由於情節太過寫實，直指「婆媳關係」永遠是一門高深學問，網民紛紛入晒戲湧入留言區大吐苦水：「有咁嘅奶奶，你敢嫁嗎？」、「嫁入呢種屋企，仇人都釋懷了！」、「太真實喇，我結婚時我奶奶都係咁！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e3170251-0499-447b-9ec9-cbd1d96ad013.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20262Xn7X45yAd1787630948.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e3170251-0499-447b-9ec9-cbd1d96ad013.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fbd258b8-374b-44c4-b037-b9dd668355b7.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026uqC6fgbdnE1787630949.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fbd258b8-374b-44c4-b037-b9dd668355b7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T04:39:41.574870+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":617,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}